# Cloudflare applies these rules to the web app's files and to its one page wherever it is served from a path
# (apps/api/wrangler.jsonc), never to the API's answers. No page may be framed, so no other site can trick an
# owner into pressing Approve; the token in an approval link's path never leaves in a Referer; nothing is
# indexed. The page an approval link opens is never stored, because the link names exactly one action.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow

/approve/*
  Cache-Control: no-store
